  "description": "Language-neutral cases for the time-travel band and window indicator (ticket 26/09/30 NON-DESTRUCTIVE-HISTORY-EDITING, design §10): every stage of HistoryPatch.timeTravel, the lines a shell shows in English and German, the controls in order with the refusal that disables one, the reserved verb each dispatches (args carry the session generation), the default remappable chords (never Escape) and the indicator's accessible name. Read by the React band test; the wgpu band reads the same cases. `transitions` are what one change of the focused program's session asks of either shell: reveal the History panel on the edge into a new session, and move keyboard focus to the draft editor's first input, the band or the finalize prompt.",
